  "description": "A companion library for ComputeWeave that writes Direct2D pixel shaders entirely in C# and registers them as ID2D1Effect. It shares the primitive types and HLSL intrinsics in ComputeWeave.Core but does not reference ComputeWeave, as these shaders are executed by Direct2D rather than on the Direct3D 12 compute queue.",
